                            name="Settlement reference data"
                            dataObjectRef="_a7d2b808-7481-410e-814d-6489175b3ecd">
         <documentation id="documentation_a7d2b808-7481-410e-814d-6489175b3ecd"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-004; CSP-ST-003.
 
Purpose: Reference information used by Settlement Operations to validate the settlement details for both currency legs.
 
Content: Applicable counterparty settlement instructions, settlement account details, currency-specific requirements, and relevant processing cut-off times.
 
Usage: Read during settlement preparation controls and checked for applicability to the trade, currency, and contractual value date. Missing, outdated, or inconsistent reference information requires investigation before the affected instructions are submitted.]]></documentation>
