      <dataObjectReference id="dataObjectReference_d86c1f2c-b4f9-4e72-a86e-8c3f3782315b"
                            name="Cancellation, recall and cash recovery evidence"
                            dataObjectRef="_d86c1f2c-b4f9-4e72-a86e-8c3f3782315b">
         <documentation id="documentation_d86c1f2c-b4f9-4e72-a86e-8c3f3782315b"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-005; CSP-ST-007; CSP-PR-008.
 
Producer: Settlement Operations, using responses and evidence obtained from SYS-SET, the counterparty and relevant operational teams.
 
Content: Trade and version references, affected currency legs and instruction identifiers, requested cancellation or recall actions, recovery amounts and currencies, approvals, action references, responses, timestamps and supporting cash movement evidence.
 
Purpose: Supports verification of each required cancellation, recall or recovery action and identification of remaining settlement or recovery obligations.
 
Requested, acknowledged and confirmed outcomes must remain distinguishable. A request or acknowledgement alone does not prove completion. Cash recovery requires evidence of the actual cash movement.]]></documentation>
