      <exclusiveGateway name="What action is required following submission investigation?"
                         id="_091f1abf-6146-4732-888c-5d85d0e430f3"
                         gatewayDirection="Diverging">
         <documentation id="documentation_091f1abf-6146-4732-888c-5d85d0e430f3"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-004; CSP-ST-004; CSP-ST-005; CSP-ST-007; CSP-PR-008.
 
Select one outcome based on the completed submission investigation.
 
Existing instructions confirmed - no correction required: The expected instructions have been identified and the discrepancy has been explained. Return to submission-result review using the confirmed evidence.
 
Safe correction or submission required: The affected instructions and required action are known, current statuses permit the action, and it can be completed within the applicable cut-off without creating duplicate settlement.
 
Safe resolution not currently possible: Instruction status remains uncertain, the required action cannot safely be completed, or the applicable cut-off prevents it. Document and escalate the exception with an assigned owner and follow-up arrangements.]]></documentation>
         <extensionElements>
            <adonis:instance>
               <adonis:attribute name="IDENTIFICATION_OF_CHANGES"
