      <endEvent name="Submission exception escalated - follow-up required"
                 id="_214c7216-9edd-461e-93ba-416787363417">
         <documentation id="documentation_214c7216-9edd-461e-93ba-416787363417"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-004; CSP-PR-005; CSP-ST-007; CSP-PR-008.
 
Outcome: The current submission or corrective-submission attempt has ended without a confirmed safe resolution. The exception, known instruction statuses, outstanding obligations, assigned owner and follow-up arrangements have been recorded and escalated.
 
Any originating settlement exception remains part of the case. Valid outstanding instructions require continued monitoring, and confirmed settled-leg history is preserved.
 
This outcome does not indicate successful settlement or completion of the trade lifecycle.]]></documentation>
