      <manualTask name="Document and escalate the unresolved settlement preparation exception"
                   id="_261402ac-c9fc-4f4a-ae76-d7cf2aaa2f42"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_261402ac-c9fc-4f4a-ae76-d7cf2aaa2f42"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-004; CSP-PR-008.
 
Input: An unresolved settlement preparation exception, or corrected information received too late to complete validation and submission before the applicable cut-off.
 
Handling: Record the affected trade, latest accepted version, impacted currency legs, exception reason, current instruction status, cut-off impact, assigned owner and required next action. Update the operational lifecycle tracker and retain the supporting investigation evidence.
 
Notify Trade Operations and the relevant exception owner. Coordinate any required counterparty communication and assessment of downstream cash or accounting impacts. Preserve existing instruction references and confirmed settlement history where applicable.
 
Output: A documented and escalated settlement preparation exception with an assigned owner, recorded operational status and follow-up action. The affected trade is not reported as successfully settled.]]></documentation>
