      <manualTask name="Document and escalate the unresolved settlement exception"
                   id="_2751eb23-7224-4dc1-b9d9-c724af005cf1"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_2751eb23-7224-4dc1-b9d9-c724af005cf1"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-005; CSP-ST-007; CSP-PR-008.
 
Input: Unresolved settlement exception and the latest known status of each currency-leg instruction.
 
Handling: Record the affected trade, instruction references, confirmed settled amounts, outstanding obligations, investigation findings and operational impact. Assign an exception owner, next action and follow-up time. Update the operational lifecycle tracker and notify the relevant teams. Arrange continued monitoring of outstanding instructions and any required recovery activity. Preserve confirmed settlement history.
 
Output: Documented unresolved settlement or recovery status, supporting evidence and an assigned owner responsible for further action. Escalation does not confirm successful settlement or completion of recovery.]]></documentation>
