      <endEvent name="Settlement exception resolved - outcome recorded"
                 id="_38fe08e9-b6e2-435c-8470-41901ad7d67a">
         <documentation id="documentation_38fe08e9-b6e2-435c-8470-41901ad7d67a"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-005; CSP-ST-007; CSP-PR-008.
 
Outcome: The required exception-resolution actions have been verified and recorded, with no outstanding settlement or recovery obligations remaining for this case.
 
Closure may result from cancellation, recall or cash recovery and must remain distinguishable from successful settlement of the original two currency legs. Supporting evidence and original settlement history are retained.]]></documentation>
