      <manualTask name="Investigate and resolve settlement preparation exceptions"
                   id="_43ce2266-6243-4e6b-9fa8-1480a681f5cd"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_43ce2266-6243-4e6b-9fa8-1480a681f5cd"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-004; CSP-PR-008.
 
Input: Settlement preparation validation failure affecting one or both currency legs.
 
Handling: Identify the missing, inconsistent or invalid details and coordinate clarification or correction with Trade Operations, the relevant reference-data owner and the counterparty where required. Record the affected trade and leg, exception reason, assigned owner, current status, supporting evidence and applicable cut-off.
 
Prevent submission of instructions that have not passed the required validation. Record whether corrected information is available for revalidation or whether the exception remains unresolved and require escalation.
 
Output: Corrected settlement information ready for revalidation, or a documented unresolved settlement preparation exception with an owner and required next action.]]></documentation>
