      <serviceTask name="Register and validate submitted settlement instructions"
                    id="_4ae009d5-c180-4321-9892-79f4e49f07d1"
                    isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_4ae009d5-c180-4321-9892-79f4e49f07d1"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-004; CSP-ST-004; CSP-ST-005.
 
Input: Settlement instruction details submitted to SYS-SET.
 
Handling: Register and validate the submitted instructions separately for each currency leg using existing SYS-SET controls. For each instruction created, provide its settlement-instruction identifier and available processing status. Report available validation failures or rejecetion reasons.
 
Preserve the relationship between each instruction, its currency leg and the originating trade and version. One leg may have a different processing outcome from the other.
 
Output: Available instruction references, processing statuses and validation or rejection information for each submitted leg. Instruction creation or acceptance does not mean that the currency leg has settled.]]></documentation>
