      <exclusiveGateway name="Are submission outcomes confirmed and free of unresolved exceptions for both legs?"
                         id="_69d39e8b-e36e-49ed-98fc-612bf082319f"
                         gatewayDirection="Diverging">
         <documentation id="documentation_69d39e8b-e36e-49ed-98fc-612bf082319f"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-004; CSP-ST-004; CSP-ST-005.
 
Decision: Confirm whether both expected currency legs have identifiable settlement instructions, correctly linked to the trade and accepted version, with known statuses and no unresolved submission exceptions.
 
Yes: Both instruction references and their submission outcomes are confirmed. Continue to settlement monitoring.
 
No: At least one instruction is missing, rejected, duplicated, incorrectly linked or has an unclear submission outcome. Investigate before considering any correction or resubmission.
 
This decision does not confirm successful settlement.
 ]]></documentation>
