      <manualTask name="Record confirmed settlement completion"
                   id="_6a1fa3bb-a707-4925-a3f2-0ebcaf4c54e1"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_6a1fa3bb-a707-4925-a3f2-0ebcaf4c54e1"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-005; CSP-ST-006.
 
Input: Confirmed full settlement of both expected currency legs.
 
Handling: Record successful settlement in the operational lifecycle tracker, retaining the trade identifier and version, both instruction references and supporting settlement confirmation evidence. Make the confirmed outcome available for downstream accounting and reconciliation activities.
 
Output: Recorded successful settlement of both currency legs. Completion of downstream accounting, NAV and reconciliation processes is outside this local outcome.]]></documentation>
