      <manualTask name="Investigate and coordinate settlement exception resolution"
                   id="_900e224d-bbd3-4199-ab55-3326523681e2"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_900e224d-bbd3-4199-ab55-3326523681e2"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-005; CSP-ST-007; CSP-PR-008.
 
Input: A settlement outcome requiring intervention on one or both currency legs.
 
Handling: Establish the latest status and failure or delay reason for each affected instruction. Coordinate investigation with the counterparty and relevant operational teams. Identify the required follow-up, correction, cancellation, recall or cash-recovery action according to the observed state.
 
Preserve settled-leg history and continue monitoring any outstanding valid instruction. Record the affected legs, assigned owner, supporting evidence, applicable cut-offs and required next action.
 
Output: An investigated settlement exception with current leg-level statuses and an identified resolution or recovery action. Investigation alone does not confirm that exception has been resolved.]]></documentation>
         <extensionElements>
            <adonis:instance>
               <adonis:attribute name="IDENTIFICATION_OF_CHANGES"
                                  type="ENUM"
                                  notebook="1"
                                  sourcelang=""
