      <manualTask name="Document and escalate the unresolved submission exception"
                   id="_960b5bec-d8bf-48cb-8eaa-bc3589850860"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_960b5bec-d8bf-48cb-8eaa-bc3589850860"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-004; CSP-PR-005; CSP-ST-005; CSP-ST-007; CSP-PR-008.
 
Input: Submission exception for which a safe correction or submission cannot currently be completed.
 
Handling: Record the affected trade and currency legs, known instruction references and statuses, investigation findings, cut-off impact and the reason further action cannot safely proceed. Update the operational lifecycle tracker, assign an exception owner and document the next action and follow-ip time. Notify the relevant operational teams and arrange continued monitoring of any valid outstanding instructions. Preserve confirmed settlement history and identify any required recovery follow-up.
 
Output: Documented unresolved submission exception, updated operational lifecycle trakcer and escalation evidence with an assigned owner and follow-up arrangements.]]></documentation>
