      <manualTask name="Coordinate cancellation, recall or cash recovery for affected legs"
                   id="_982aa515-d509-474d-8209-66f68d6a9f1c"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_982aa515-d509-474d-8209-66f68d6a9f1c"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-005; CSP-ST-007; CSP-PR-008.
 
Input: Investigated settlement exception, current statuses of both currency legs and the agreed resolution action.
 
Handling: Coordinate the required cancellation, recall or cash recovery with the counterparty and relevant operational teams. Identify the affected instructions and amounts, obtain the required approvals and retain action references and supporting evidence. Preserve valid instructions for unaffected legs and confirmed settlement history. Track each requested action separately from its confirmed outcome.
 
Output: Documented resolution actions and available responses, ready for outcome verification. Submission or acknowledgement of a request alone does not establish successful cancellation, recall or recovery.]]></documentation>
