      <exclusiveGateway name="What is the overall settlement outcome?"
                         id="_a4b7d776-a515-4a80-b207-a3e45e97ebec"
                         gatewayDirection="Diverging">
         <documentation id="documentation_a4b7d776-a515-4a80-b207-a3e45e97ebec"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-005; CSP-ST-006; CSP-ST-007.
 
Decision: Classify the trade using the lates confirmed statuses of both expected currency legs.
 
Both legs settled: Both legs are confirmed as fully settled, with no unresolved discrepancy affecting that conclusion.
 
Pending within the applicable settlement window - no exception: At least one leg remains pending, but the available statuses and timing indicate that no intervention is currently required.
 
Settlement exception requires action: A failed, rejected, overdue, cancelled, recalled, inconsistent or unclear outcome requires investigation or recovery. This also includes partial settlement requiring intervention.
 
Only the first outcome permits the trade to be recorded as successfully settled.]]></documentation>
