      <manualTask name="Record the resolved exception outcome"
                   id="_e6ef8f1a-1d9b-4f2d-a387-e593da1a2892"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_e6ef8f1a-1d9b-4f2d-a387-e593da1a2892"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-005; CSP-ST-007; CSP-PR-008.
 
Input: Verified completion of all required resolution action with no outstanding settlement or recovery obligations for the case.
 
Handling: Record the final outcome for each currency leg, original instruction references, cancellation or recall results and any confirmed recovery movements. Update the operational lifecycle tracker and make the evidence available to downstream accounting and reconciliation teams. Preserve the distinction between successful original settlement and closure through exception resolution.
 
Output: Recorded resolution of the settlement exception with supporting evidence and no outstanding actions within this settlement case.]]></documentation>
