      <endEvent name="Settlement exception escalated - follow-up required"
                 id="_e865d92b-6cb1-4389-8457-d42959e73b2b">
         <documentation id="documentation_e865d92b-6cb1-4389-8457-d42959e73b2b"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-005; CSP-ST-007; CSP-PR-008.
 
Outcome: The settlement or recovery exception remains unresolved, or its resolution cannot be confirmed from the available evidence.
 
The latest known leg-level statuses, outstanding obligations, investigation evidence, assigned owner, next action and follow-up time have been recorded and escalated. Continued monitoring or recovery remains required as applicable.
 
This outcome does not indicate successful settlement or completed recovery.]]></documentation>
