      <exclusiveGateway name="What is the confirmed outcome of the resolution actions?"
                         id="_e8cdc6a5-64ec-4f85-9846-5dbd9000a1bc"
                         gatewayDirection="Diverging">
         <documentation id="documentation_e8cdc6a5-64ec-4f85-9846-5dbd9000a1bc"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-005; CSP-ST-006; CSP-ST-007; CSP-PR-008.
 
Decision: Classify the case using verified cancellation, recall or cash recovery outcomes and the latest statuses of both currency legs.
 
Resolution complete - no outstanding settlement or recovery obligations: All required resolution actions are confirmed and no settlement or recovery obligations remain for this case. Record the resolved exception outcome.
 
Recovery actions complete - settlement monitoring still required: The required recovery actions are confirmed, but valid outstanding settlement instructions still require monitoring. Return to settlement monitoring.
 
Resolution incomplete or unconfirmed: At least one required action remains incomplete, rejected, contradictory or unsupported by sufficient evidence. Document and escalate the unresolved settlement exception.
 
A submitted request or acknowledgement alone does not establish successful cancellation, recall or cash recovery.]]></documentation>
         <extensionElements>
