      <manualTask name="Prepare settlement instructions for both currency legs"
                   id="_ea01d464-4d95-4b5b-ba31-cba13fa6effc"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_ea01d464-4d95-4b5b-ba31-cba13fa6effc"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-004
 
Input: Reviewed maturity population and validated settlement reference data for both currency legs.
 
Handling: Prepare the settlement instruction details for each currency leg using the latest accepted trade version. Maintain the relationship between the trade, its version and the corresponding pay and receive legs. Check existing instructions and their statuses before preparing new instructions to prevent duplicate settlement requests.
 
Output: Prepared settlement instruction for both currency legs, ready for input and submission to SYS-SET. Preparation alone does not confirm submission, acceptance or settlement.]]></documentation>
