      <manualTask name="Verify cancellation, recall or cash recovery for affected legs"
                   id="_f2a08020-6735-4677-af97-2d2af8e2eebe"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_f2a08020-6735-4677-af97-2d2af8e2eebe"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-005; CSP-ST-005; CSP-ST-006; CSP-ST-007.
 
Input: Resolution-action references, current SYS-SET statuses, counterparty responses and relevant cash movement evidence.
 
Handling: Verify the outcome of each required cancellation, recall or recovery action. For cash recovery, confirm the actual movement using relevant cash evidence. Establish the remaining settlement and recovery obligations for both currency legs, preserving their original settlement history. Identify any incomplete, rejected, contradictory or unconfirmed outcomes.
 
Output: Verified resolution status and evidence supporting closure, continued settlement monitoring or escalation.]]></documentation>
