      <exclusiveGateway name="Are the affected instructions ready for safe submission before the applicable cut-off?"
                         id="_fb23459c-e5b3-4634-8861-ae9e46126015"
                         gatewayDirection="Diverging">
         <documentation id="documentation_fb23459c-e5b3-4634-8861-ae9e46126015"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-004; CSP-PR-005; CSP-ST-003; CSP-ST-004; CSP-ST-007; CSP-PR-008.
 
Decision: Confirm whether controlled preparation has produced validated instructions that can safely be submitted within the applicable cut-off.
 
Yes: The affected instructions and currency legs are explicitly identified, required details and controls are complete, current instruction statuses permit the action, and sufficient time remains for submission. Any replacement instruction is supported by confirmation that the original instruction cannot also settle. Continue to RETRY_SETTLEMENT_SUBMISSION.
 
No: Preparation or validation remains incomplete, instruction status is uncertain, duplicate settlement cannot be excluded, or the applicable cut-off prevents safe submission. Document and escalate the unresolved submission exception.
 
Preserve valid instructions for unaffected legs and confirmed settlement history. Where the case originated from a settlement exception, retain that context and all outstanding obligations in the escalation.]]></documentation>
         <extensionElements>
            <adonis:instance>
               <adonis:attribute name="IDENTIFICATION_OF_CHANGES"
                                  type="ENUM"
                                  notebook="1"
                                  sourcelang=""
                                  novalue="0"
                                  lang-independent="v0">
                  <adonis:value>No change</adonis:value>
                  <adonis:metavalue/>
               </adonis:attribute>
               <adonis:attribute name="REPRESENTATION_NAME_GATEWAY"
                                  type="ENUM"
                                  notebook="1"
                                  sourcelang=""
                                  novalue="0"
                                  lang-independent="v1">
                  <adonis:value>below</adonis:value>
                  <adonis:metavalue/>
               </adonis:attribute>
               <adonis:attribute name="A_NEED_FOR_ACTION_CS"
                                  type="BOOL"
                                  notebook="1"
                                  sourcelang=""
                                  novalue="0">
                  <adonis:value>false</adonis:value>
